# Two Connecting the Dots (the second cast on turn 3) both trigger when the Ornithopter attacks, so each exiles one card
# face down, linked to its own enchantment (CR 607.2a). Sacrificing one of them puts only the card it exiled into the
# hand: the other card stays in exile, waiting for the other enchantment.

